### Get BankAccount by ID
GET https://localhost:7053/api/biller/bankaccount/1

### Get all BankAccounts
GET https://localhost:7053/api/biller/bankaccount

### Lookup BankAccounts
GET https://localhost:7053/api/biller/bankaccount/lookup

### Create BankAccount
POST https://localhost:7053/api/biller/bankaccount
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "TenantID": 0,
  "AccountName": "Sample",
  "BankName": "Sample",
  "AccountNumber": "Sample",
  "BranchCode": "Sample",
  "AccountType": "Sample",
  "SwiftCode": "Sample",
  "IsDefault": "Sample",
  "Active": "Sample",
  "Tenant": "Sample"
}

### Update BankAccount
PUT https://localhost:7053/api/biller/bankaccount
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "TenantID": 0,
  "AccountName": "Sample",
  "BankName": "Sample",
  "AccountNumber": "Sample",
  "BranchCode": "Sample",
  "AccountType": "Sample",
  "SwiftCode": "Sample",
  "IsDefault": "Sample",
  "Active": "Sample",
  "Tenant": "Sample"
}

### Delete BankAccount
DELETE https://localhost:7053/api/biller/bankaccount/1
